# MAX Sender — project rules

## Product

Bulk messaging for MAX messenger. Dual mode: **local** (exe/run.bat) + **server** (Docker/Caddy).

## Before Any Feature Work

1. Load `.cursor/skills/context-loading/SKILL.md`
2. For new features: `/start-feature` → Feature Plan → **user approval** → implement
3. Run `@verifier` before marking done
4. Parent agent updates `.cursor/project-management/` — specialists do not

## Code Boundaries

| Area | Path | Rule |
|------|------|------|
| Shared backend | `main.py`, `antiban_core.py` | Both modes use this |
| Server extensions | `server/app/hooks.py` | Server-only differences |
| Infra | `server/docker-compose.yml`, `caddy/` | Server only |
| UI | `static/index.html` | Shared admin panel |
| Secrets | `data/.app_key`, `server/.env` | Never commit |

## Security

- API PIN required for public server deploy
- Session files = account access — Fernet encryption must stay intact
- Unofficial API — document risks; do not remove antiban defaults without approval

## Agents

See `.cursor/agents/README.md` and `docs/MASTER-AI-WORKFLOW.md`.

## Model policy

GPT-5.5 for planning · Composer 2.5 for implementation · Opus only for architecture/security ADRs.
